{"passive":{"name":"Death in Lavender ","description":"Bel'Veth gains permanent attack speed stacks after taking down large minions and monsters and champions. She also gains temporary bonus attack speed after using an ability."},"primaryAbilities":[{"slot":"Q","name":"Void Surge","enginePath":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQ","maxRank":5,"description":"Bel'Veth dashes in a chosen direction and damages all enemies she passes through.","tooltipTemplate":"Bel'Veth dashes, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ basedamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> to enemies she passes through.<br /><br />Each direction has an unique Cooldown of {{ f1 }} seconds that scales down based on her <attackSpeed>Attack Speed</attackSpeed>.<br />{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[4,3.25,2.5,1.75,1],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[450,450,450,450,450],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"},{"slot":"W","name":"Above and Below","enginePath":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethWAbility/BelvethW","maxRank":5,"description":"Bel'Veth slams her tail to the ground, damaging, knocking up, and slowing her enemies.","tooltipTemplate":"Bel'Veth slams her tail, dealing <magicDamage>{{ damage }} magic damage</magicDamage>, <status>Knocking Up</status> foes for {{ duration }} seconds, and <status>Slowing</status> them by {{ slowpercent*100 }}% for {{ slowduration }} seconds. If a champion is hit, this refreshes the Cooldown of <spellName>Void Surge</spellName> in that direction.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[12,11,10,9,8],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[715,715,715,715,715],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"},{"slot":"E","name":"Royal Maelstrom","enginePath":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethEAbility/BelvethE","maxRank":5,"description":"Bel'Veth roots herself in place, channeling a storm of slashes around her that targets the lowest-health enemy and grants her lifesteal and damage reduction.","tooltipTemplate":"Bel'Veth channels and slashes around herself, gaining {{ drpercent*100 }}% Damage Reduction, {{ totallifesteal }} Life Steal, and Attacking {{ f2.0 }} times over {{ totalduration }} seconds with the number of Attacks increasing based on her <attackSpeed>Attack Speed</attackSpeed>. Each Attack strikes the lowest-health enemy, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ damageperstrike }}</physicalDamage> to <physicalDamage>{{ maxdamageperstriketooltip }} physical damage</physicalDamage> based on the target's missing Health.<br /><br />Using another Ability or <recast>Recasting</recast> ends this Ability early.<br />{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[24,21,18,15,12],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[500,500,500,500,500],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"},{"slot":"R","name":"Endless Banquet","enginePath":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethRAbility/BelvethR","maxRank":3,"description":"Bel'Veth consumes Void coral remnants, transforming into her true form and increasing her max health, attack range, and attack speed. Consuming the Void coral remnants of a Void epic monster will grant her the power to summon Void remora.","tooltipTemplate":"<spellPassive>Passive:</spellPassive> Attacks deal an additional <trueDamage>{{ finalonhitdamage }} true damage</trueDamage>, stacking infinitely. Takedowns against champions and epic monsters leave behind a piece of Void Coral.<br /><br /><spellActive>Active:</spellActive> Bel'Veth consumes a Void Coral, gaining <keywordMajor>{{ passivestacksondevour }} Lavender</keywordMajor> stack and activating her true form. Void Coral from void epic monsters causes minions that die nearby to become Void Remora. While casting, Bel'Veth <status>Slows</status> nearby enemies before exploding, dealing <trueDamage>{{ totalexplosiondamage }} + {{ missinghealthdamage*100 }}% missing-Health true damage</trueDamage>.<br /><br />In her true form, Bel'Veth gains <healing>{{ maxhealthondevour }} max Health</healing>, {{ bonusaarange }} Attack range, <attackSpeed>{{ totalasmod*100 }}% Total Attack Speed</attackSpeed>, and <spellName>Void Surge</spellName> can pass through walls.<br /><br /><rules>True form lasts {{ steroidduration }} seconds, increased to {{ steroiddurationupgrade }} seconds at <keywordMajor>{{ stackthresholdforupgrade }} Lavender</keywordMajor> stacks. At <keywordMajor>{{ stackthresholdforpermanent }} Lavender</keywordMajor> stacks, true form lasts until death.</rules><br /><br /><br />{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[1,1,1],"costByRank":[0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[450,450,450],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"}],"allSpellRecords":[{"path":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQHudIcon4","internalName":"BelvethQHudIcon4","primarySlot":null,"name":"BelvethQHudIcon4","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataValuesRaw":{},"effectAmountsRaw":[],"calculations":{},"unresolvedTooltipTokens":[]},{"path":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQHudIcon5","internalName":"BelvethQHudIcon5","primarySlot":null,"name":"BelvethQHudIcon5","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataValuesRaw":{},"effectAmountsRaw":[],"calculations":{},"unresolvedTooltipTokens":[]},{"path":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQHudIcon6","internalName":"BelvethQHudIcon6","primarySlot":null,"name":"BelvethQHudIcon6","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataValuesRaw":{},"effectAmountsRaw":[],"calculations":{},"unresolvedTooltipTokens":[]},{"path":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQHudIcon7","internalName":"BelvethQHudIcon7","primarySlot":null,"name":"BelvethQHudIcon7","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataValuesRaw":{},"effectAmountsRaw":[],"calculations":{},"unresolvedTooltipTokens":[]},{"path":"Characters/Belveth/Spells/BelvethQAbility/BelvethQHudIcon0","internalName":"BelvethQHudIcon0","primarySlot":null,"name":"BelvethQHudIcon0","summary":"","tooltipWithSymbolicValues":"","dataValuesRaw":{},"effectAmountsRaw":[],"calculations":{},"unresolvedTooltipTokens":[]},{"path":"Char